I have fixed the background style issue with soft wrap by adjusting how `cell_offset` is calculated during word folding in `rich/_wrap.py`. The change ensures that the cell offset correctly accumulates the length of each segment of a chopped word, which resolves potential issues with style application during wrapping.

The fix has been verified by running the test suite.

